Subject: [PATCH] Ownership: contrarian value plays by position (low-owned,
 strong projection/value, soft matchups)

New GET /api/ownership/:slateId/contrarian (Champion) and a panel on the Ownership Heatmap.
Selection is per position: projects above the position median (or strong pts per $1k), owned at
or below the position median (capped at 10%), ranked by projection x value / ownership, with the
ESPN defense-vs-position multiplier flagging sneaky matchups.

